-- הסכם עוז לתמורה (14.8.2011), §45 העלאת תעריף הקצובה לביגוד למורים לחינוך
-- גופני: from the school year תשע"א, the clothing allowance tariff of a
-- physical-education teacher is raised by 800, which is meant also for
-- buying products that protect the skin from the sun; the rules for
-- updating that tariff every school year are unchanged.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `45 העלאת תעריף הקצובה לביגוד למורים לחינוך גופני`

§§ `45(א)`

-- (א): from the school year תשע"א (from 1.9.2010; convention
-- dates.school-year) — a year before the agreement's first — the clothing
-- allowance tariff for a physical-education teacher is raised by 800.
-- The rise is meant also for products that protect the skin from the sun:
-- a purpose, which does not narrow it (convention precedence.rationale).
-- The tariff it raises is the one in force for the year, set elsewhere
-- (convention amounts.inputs); (ב) leaves its yearly update as it was, so
-- the tariff raised in תשע"א is the one the later updates carry forward.
-- The encoding gives תשע"א's raised tariff; a later year's is the update
-- rules', which are not this agreement's.
@ref akn:art_45__para_a
`the school year 5771` MEANS 2010

`the rise section 45 gives the physical-education teacher's tariff` MEANS 800

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 45 raises the physical-education tariff in` y IF
    y AT LEAST `the school year 5771`

GIVEN `the physical-education tariff for 5771 before the rise` IS A NUMBER @desc the tariff in force for a physical-education teacher in the school year תשע"א, without section 45
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the physical-education teacher's clothing tariff for 5771 under section 45` `the physical-education tariff for 5771 before the rise` IS
    `the physical-education tariff for 5771 before the rise` PLUS `the rise section 45 gives the physical-education teacher's tariff`

§§ `45(ב)`

-- (ב): for the avoidance of doubt, the rules for updating the physical-
-- education teacher's clothing allowance every school year are unchanged.
@ref akn:art_45__para_b
`why the yearly update of the physical-education tariff is not here` MEANS
    `set elsewhere` "הכללים לעדכון הקצובה לביגוד למורה לחינוך גופני מידי שנת לימודים, מחוץ להסכם זה"

§§ `45 -- illustrations`

#ASSERT `section 45 raises the physical-education tariff in` `the school year 5771`
#ASSERT `section 45 raises the physical-education tariff in` `the school year 5772`
#ASSERT NOT `section 45 raises the physical-education tariff in` 2009
#ASSERT `the physical-education teacher's clothing tariff for 5771 under section 45` 1200 EQUALS 2000
